<title>DUBAI: Saudi Aramco lifts A-888 bunker diesel prices.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco lifts A-888 bunker diesel prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco has increased A-888 bunker diesel prices from Ras Tanura and Dammam by $3 a tonne to $238 a tonne with effect Janaury 9, the company said.</p>
<p>A-960 bunker fuel is left unchanged at $125 a tonne ($19.19 a barrel) and from Jeddah and Yanbu will be $129 a tonne ($19.80). A-888 from the Red Sea is $241 a tonne.</p>
</text>
